OL,3,GNEWSAMillions to be invested in oldest
OL,4,Ahigh school building in Inverness
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council says it will invest
OL,7,Fmillions of pounds in the oldest
OL,8,Fsecondary school building in Inverness.
OL,10,FThe original part of Inverness High
OL,11,FSchool dates from the late 1930s and
OL,12,Fextensions were added in following
OL,13,Fdecades, including the 1970s.
OL,15,FThe local authority renovated the main
OL,16,Fbuilding, including classrooms, about
OL,17,Feight years ago at a cost of #14.7m.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
