OL,3,GNEWSAMillions to be invested in oldest
OL,4,Ahigh school building in Inverness
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the new proposals, a sports block
OL,7,Fwith a fitness suite and a community
OL,8,Froom, a sports pitch and an additional
OL,9,Fsupport needs (ASN) base are to be
OL,10,Fbuilt.
